#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:397 FractionRingWidget.cpp:432
msgid "Now the parts of the inside ring and outside ring has"
msgstr "Agora as partes do anel interior e do exterior teñen"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:398 FractionRingWidget.cpp:433
msgid ""
" the same size, now we can add the fractions!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" o mesmo tamaño, agora podemos sumar as fraccións!\n"
"\n"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:399 FractionRingWidget.cpp:434
msgid "This is called finding the main denominator. "
msgstr "Isto chámase calcular denominador común."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:400 FractionRingWidget.cpp:435
msgid "The main denominator divide the rings in equal parts."
msgstr "O denominador común divide os aneis en partes iguais."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:403 FractionRingWidget.cpp:438
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"There is a smaller main denominator, can you find it?."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Hai un denominador común máis cativo, pode achalo?"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:410
msgid "You just multiplied the first fraction by "
msgstr "Acaba de multiplicar a primeira fracción por"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:412 FractionRingWidget.cpp:447
msgid ". Our main goal is to make all parts be the same size."
msgstr ". O noso propósito é facer que todas as partes teñan o mesmo tamaño."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:413 FractionRingWidget.cpp:448
msgid "Try multiply the first fraction by "
msgstr "Proba multiplicando a primeira fracción por"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:415 FractionRingWidget.cpp:450
msgid " and the second fraction by "
msgstr "e a segunda por"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:417 FractionRingWidget.cpp:452
msgid "."
msgstr "."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:445
msgid "You just multiplied the second fraction by "
msgstr "Acabas de multiplicar a segunda fracción por"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:485
msgid "The outside ring represents the left fraction. "
msgstr "O anel exterior representa a fracción da esquerda."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:487 FractionRingWidget.cpp:492
msgid " of "
msgstr " de "

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:489 FractionRingWidget.cpp:494
msgid ""
" painted parts.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" partes pintadas.\n"
"\n"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:490
msgid "The inside ring represents the right fraction. "
msgstr "O anel interior representa a fracción da dereita."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:495
#| msgid "The 'Multiply' buttom multiply each fraction. Try one of then!"
msgid "The 'Multiply' button multiplies each fraction. Try one of them!"
msgstr "O botón \"Multiplicar\" multiplica cada fracción. Proba cun deles!"

#: exercisecompare.cpp:102
msgid "Click on this button to select the more sign."
msgstr "Prema neste botón para escoller o signo de maior."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:111
msgid "Click on this button to select the minor sign."
msgstr "Prema neste botón para escoller o signo de menor."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:120
msgid "Click on this button to select the equal sign."
msgstr "Prema neste botón para escoller o signo de igual."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:131 exercisecompare.cpp:289 exerciseconvert.cpp:149
#: exercisefactorize.cpp:179 exercisepercentage.cpp:168 taskview.cpp:154
msgid "&Skip"
msgstr "&Saltar"

#: exercisecompare.cpp:132 exerciseconvert.cpp:150 exercisefactorize.cpp:180
#: exercisepercentage.cpp:169 taskview.cpp:155
msgid "Click on this button to skip this question."
msgstr "Prema neste botón para saltar esta pregunta."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:146
msgid "In this exercise you have to compare 2 given fractions."
msgstr "Neste exercicio terá que comparar dúas fraccións dadas."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:147
msgid ""
"In this exercise you have to compare 2 given fractions by choosing the "
"correct comparison sign. You can change the comparison sign by just clicking "
"on the button showing the sign."
msgstr ""
"Neste exercicio, terá que comparar 2 fraccións dadas, escollendo o signo de "
"comparación correcto. Poderá trocar o signo de comparación, simplemente "
"premendo no botón que o mostra."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:254 exercisecompare.cpp:255 exercisecompare.cpp:256
msgid "Click on this button to check your result."
msgstr "Prema neste botón para verificar o seu resultado."

#: exercisecompare.cpp:304 exercisecompare.cpp:318 exercisecompare.cpp:332
msgid "&Next"
msgstr "&Seguinte"

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:102 taskview.cpp:107
msgid "Enter the numerator of your result"
msgstr "Escriba o numerador do seu resultado"

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:120 taskview.cpp:125
msgid "Enter the denominator of your result"
msgstr "Escriba o denominador do seu resultado"

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:138 exerciseconvert.cpp:193 exerciseconvert.cpp:434
#: exercisefactorize.cpp:189 exercisefactorize.cpp:294
#: exercisefactorize.cpp:511 exercisepercentage.cpp:157
#: exercisepercentage.cpp:214 exercisepercentage.cpp:598 taskview.cpp:143
#: taskview.cpp:240 taskview.cpp:384
msgid "&Check"
msgstr "&Comprobar"

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:140 exerciseconvert.cpp:395 exercisefactorize.cpp:190
#: exercisefactorize.cpp:415 exercisepercentage.cpp:159
#: exercisepercentage.cpp:553 taskview.cpp:145 taskview.cpp:337
msgid ""
"Click on this button to check your result. The button will not work if you "
"have not entered a result yet."
msgstr ""
"Prema neste botón para verificar o seu resultado. O botón non funcionará se "
"non indicase un resultado."

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:164
msgid "In this exercise you have to convert a number into a fraction."
msgstr "Nestes exercicios, terá que converter un número nunha fracción."

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:165
msgid ""
"In this exercise you have to convert a given number into a fraction by "
"entering numerator and denominator. Do not forget to reduce the result."
msgstr ""
"Neste exercicio, terá que converter un número nunha fracción, indicando o "
"numerador e o denominador. Non se esqueza de reducir o resultado"

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:331 exercisefactorize.cpp:363
#: exercisepercentage.cpp:466 taskview.cpp:273
msgid "Click on this button to get to the next question."
msgstr "Prema neste botón para pasar á seguinte pregunta."

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:378 taskview.cpp:321
msgid ""
"You entered a 0 as the denominator. This means division by zero, which is "
"not allowed. This question will be counted as not correctly solved."
msgstr ""
"Escribiu un cero como denominador. Isto significa unha división por cero, o "
"que non está permitido. Esta pregunta contarase como incorrecto."

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:384 taskview.cpp:327
msgid ""
"You entered the correct result, but not reduced.\n"
"Always enter your results as reduced. This question will be counted as not "
"correctly solved."
msgstr ""
"Escrebiu o resultado correcto, pero non reducido.\n"
"Escriba sempre o resultado reducido. Esta pregunta hase contar como "
"incorrecta."

